= Topology of projective spaces

Define the *real projective space*
$
RR P^n := (RR^(n + 1) \\ {0}) slash ~
$
where $u ~ v <==> u = lambda v$ for some nonzero $lambda in RR$.

Define the *Grassmannian* $"Gr"_k (V)$ as the space of $k$-dimensional linear subspaces of $V$.

